    <string name="posix_warning_body" tools:ignore="TypographyDashes">Please note, when mounting ext4 or other POSIX compatible filesystems, the app needs to change the ownership of the file(s)/folder(s) to access the image on Android.\n\nBy default, when unmounted, permissions will be reset to UID/GID 1000:1000 and 775 (rwxrwxr-x) for directories and 664 (rw-rw-r--) for files.\n\nYou can enable \'Restore permissions\' in image options, but this can result in reduced security.\n\nThis message will only appear once.</string>
